        },
        "text_p7JaYJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>ELEGANT. QUALITY. MINIMAL.TIMELESS.</strong></p><p>Rebuilding intimate wear from the ground up.</p><p>The foundations of HEAVENLY were defined by a personal refusal to accept that the clothes worn closest to the body, that matter most to our health, are made from plastic or toxic chemicals.</p><p>Inspired by the Bible and ancient textiles that clothed kings for thousands of years, we've created essentials that combine modernity and minimalism with the integrity of plant-based, natural fibers.</p><p>The name HEAVENLY is a reminder of bridging Heaven on Earth, by intentionally choosing what touches your skin (the house of your spirit), and covering your temple with materials from the Earth.</p><p>— Lilly Anne, Founder</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
