    "double-1": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "heading-1-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "ABOUT",
            "text_size": 7,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "text-1-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>From the founder: </strong>After years of suffering from chronic and unexplainable health issues, including PCOS (Polycystic Ovary Syndrome), Endometriosis, painful periods and an autoimmune condition on my feminine area, I began a holistic healing journey to address the root cause of my ailments and reverse them naturally. Taking my health into my own hands included switching out chemical-laden conventional clothing and synthetic (plastic/polyester), petroleum-based fabrics for natural fiber alternatives.  When I started wearing linen fabric, my ‘incurable’ skin condition miraculously healed and my hormonal imbalances regulated. </p><p>After healing myself naturally, I was empowered to turn my pain into purpose. I completed my Undergraduate education from UCLA, and my Masters degree from USC, with the life mission of helping others. Working in the modeling industry, with a passion for fashion, I knew it was my souls purpose to share the life-giving benefits of this ancient miracle fabric with the world. Soft, luxurious, modern and stylish 100% Organic linen underwear did not exist, so I decided to create it myself— and Heavenly Essentials was born. I am delighted to be apart of your path to a healthier, more radiant life!</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 8
          }
        },
